{"doc": "`n` is even: it is twice a natural number (Definition 1.1). ", "fingerprint": "pl-fp-v1:a2514da741fb42660e227ed84561ac546c4e4f8e59d16eacaaee94b6a6d2204e", "kind": "def", "legacy_hash": "315e3b367a8a49bfe8f200f378723219", "module": "Toy.Defs", "name": "Toy.IsEven", "range": {"end_line": 10, "line": 9}, "review": {"current": [{"by": "a.referee", "hash": "pl-fp-v1:a2514da741fb42660e227ed84561ac546c4e4f8e59d16eacaaee94b6a6d2204e", "kind": "human", "name": "Toy.IsEven", "provenance": "self-declared", "target": "def", "text": "Definition 1.1: `n` is even if `n = 2k` for some natural `k`. The definition is\n`∃ k, n = 2 * k`."}], "stale": [], "state": "reviewed"}, "signature": {"segments": [{"ref": "Nat", "t": "Nat"}, {"t": " → "}, {"t": "Prop"}], "text": "Nat → Prop"}, "uses": [], "value": {"segments": [{"t": "fun "}, {"t": "n"}, {"t": " => "}, {"t": "∃ "}, {"t": "k"}, {"t": ", "}, {"t": "n"}, {"t": " = "}, {"t": "2"}, {"t": " * "}, {"t": "k"}], "text": "fun n => ∃ k, n = 2 * k"}}
